ative. So we maintain vote for C, but note we need to probe further on C's communication.\n\nThus public message: agree with Sarah that B's cooperation issues are concerning, reinforcing my view that C remains stronger. Provide evidence: C's positive crew atmosphere vs B's uncooperative. So maintain vote for C.\n\nLet's craft."}
